<h1>Healthcare</h1>
<p class="story-lead">Inspections for clinical rooms and the plant rooms were tracked apart. A check that failed in the morning was hard to find by the afternoon round.</p>
<p>Compliance visits, work on the plant, and vendor callouts each had their own list. The team that had to act could not see which check was still open.</p>
<p>They kept inspections, assets, and vendor jobs on one record. Clinical areas and plant rooms now show the same open work, and the next round starts from what is still unfinished.</p>
